    "body": "## What\n\nOne new row in `skills/sglang-explainer-video/references/troubleshooting.md`.\n\n## Why\n\nWhile building the SGLang Diffusion bottlenecks video (「视频生成为什么慢？三种瓶颈对应三把刀」), the narration `FastWan2.2 只跑 3 步` produced the caption groups `FastWan2.` and `2 只跑 3 步，`:\n\n- edge-tts tokenized `2 只` (number + Chinese classifier) as one word, so `merge_split_terms` could not re-join `FastWan2.2`;\n- `attach_punct` then treated the `.` as a sentence end and the caption group broke inside the term.\n\nThe existing check (groups that end without punctuation) does not catch it, because the group ends in `.`.\n\nFix used: put a comma right after the term (`FastWan2.2，只跑 3 步`) and re-TTS that one line. The new row records the symptom, the cause and this fix, plus what to scan for in `caption_groups.json`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
